A rougher pitch, a livelier ground, and two match fixes.

• Skipping a match no longer shows one score on the pitch and a different one on the summary.
• Season quests that ask you to win games now count them.
• The home pitch matches your stadium: mud and puddles at the bottom of the pyramid, mown stripes at the top, and a touchline at every level.
• More life around the ground — flags and scarves in the big crowds, lit windows at night.
